## Limits (12 October 2026)

The comparison runs on the hardware GPU (ANGLE Metal) by default (`settings.json` `shaders.browser_gpu`: auto); SwiftShader was not measured. Edge pixels of very sharp masks may differ by a few levels between float32 GPU and float64 numpy; the mean threshold absorbs that, the max is reported. Only two seed blocks exist; the dataset itself is the next task. (12 October 2026)
